1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Signal Foundry turns market hypotheses into research that can be traced, tested and reproduced.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Exploration and comparison work, but a native freeze, authorization and final-evaluation flow is missing.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The agent extends a data connector and two research environments, preserving input identity and failures.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
This run retains 77 factor definitions, 20 strategy mechanisms and 40 formally evaluated versions.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Research begins with factor definitions and fit evidence. A single score is not enough to enter a strategy.

6
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Mechanisms, revisions, diagnostic controls and failure reasons form an inspectable research history.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The frozen strategy has positive net proxy return but negative relative utility: no declared advantage.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
This case demonstrates capability growth and reuse. It does not turn a failed study into a winning strategy.
